Patent note
-----------

The ViBe algorithm (Barnich & Van Droogenbroeck, University of Liège) is patented
in some jurisdictions. The Apache-2.0 patent grant in the LITIV license is made by
the LITIV authors and does not extend to that third-party patent. Recipients are
responsible for determining whether a patent license is required in their
jurisdiction. See the repository-root `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.
